render-fold: add `page_index` to sidecar annotations, a pure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`continuation.rs` planner (marker grammar, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nearest-earlier-text-highlight walk, page-aware seams, range labels), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a group render path. Every text highlight renders through the group [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, so unmerged notes stay byte-identical. Also add head-ID identity, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]redirect stubs for published follower anchors, and per-piece task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity with group 🔖 links, plus a Gas Town golden test and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-vault dry-run regression check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Continuation counters, scan output, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]scan-visibility-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render-fold[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan-visibility-docs: surface merged and dangling continuations in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verbose plan, write report, per-PDF scan line, and scan JSON. Document [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the gesture, seam rule, identity rules, and stubs in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/highlights-ref-sync.md and the README. Record the decisions strand [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]if accepted.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plural page labels in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-pp-label[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-pp-label: in the linked bob-mac-capture repo, make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`RefsCopyFormat.shortPageLabel` render `Pages 11–12` as `pp. 11–12`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching `Page 11` → `p. 11`, with tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9p","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_be